                <span class="dungeon-tag">C#</span>
                <span class="dungeon-tag">OOP</span>
                <span class="dungeon-tag">Game Design</span>
            </div>
            <a class="dungeon-link" href="https://parzykmv.itch.io/el-juego-mas-perron-de-todos-el-tank-game" target="_blank">
                [ View on itch.io → ]
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="dungeon-card">
            <div class="dungeon-rank">◆ RANK B — SOLO CLEAR</div>
            <div class="dungeon-title">Scissor, Rock & Paper Fighter</div>
            <div class="dungeon-desc">
                Strategic fighting game built on rock-paper-scissors combat logic.
                Features real-time combat gameplay, character interactions,
                and refined player feedback systems.
            </div>
            <div class="dungeon-tags">
                <span class="dungeon-tag">Unity</span>
                <span class="dungeon-tag">C#</span>
                <span class="dungeon-tag">Combat Systems</span>
                <span class="dungeon-tag">Game Balance</span>
