            </div>
            <div class="dungeon-tags">
                <span class="dungeon-tag">GameMaker</span>
                <span class="dungeon-tag">Team Dev</span>
                <span class="dungeon-tag">2D Action</span>
                <span class="dungeon-tag">Debugging</span>
